Secret Hitler — Table Companion
An unofficial, non-commercial fan-made companion app.

Copyright (c) 2026 Diego Soria

================================================================================
NOTICE OF ORIGIN AND MODIFICATION
================================================================================

This work is an ADAPTATION of "Secret Hitler", a tabletop social deduction game.

Original work:
    Secret Hitler
    Designed by Mike Boxleiter, Tommy Maranges and Max Temkin
    Illustrated by Mackenzie Schubert
    Published by Goat, Wolf & Cabbage
    https://www.secrethitler.com/

The original work is licensed under a Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

CHANGES MADE: This is a modified adaptation, not a reproduction. The original is
a physical tabletop game with printed components. This adaptation reimplements
its rules as a digital multi-device web application. Specifically:

  - Secret roles are dealt automatically to each player's own device, replacing
    physical envelopes and the closed-eyes night phase.
  - Voting is conducted privately on each device, replacing printed Ja/Nein
    ballot cards.
  - The policy deck, election tracker and presidential powers are tracked
    automatically rather than with physical tiles and markers.
  - All visual design, typography, colour palette, layout and wording are
    original to this adaptation. NO original artwork, illustration, graphic
    design or printed component from the published game is reproduced here.
  - Features with no printed equivalent have been added: a proceedings log,
    animal avatars for players in the waiting room, and full-screen
    announcements of enacted policies and election results.
  - An OPTIONAL VARIANT has been added that is not part of the original game.
    It introduces six additional hidden roles - Churchill, The Spy, the
    Gestapo, The Italian, the Doppelganger and The Executioner - whose
    information structure is adapted from the roles Merlin, Percival, Mordred,
    Oberon, Morgana and the Assassin in the tabletop game "The Resistance:
    Avalon" by Don Eskridge. These roles are an original reimplementation
    written for this adaptation; no text, artwork or component from Avalon is
    reproduced, and this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
    creators or publishers of Avalon. The variant is off by default, and the
    game plays by the standard published rules unless it is switched on.

THIS IS NOT AN OFFICIAL PRODUCT. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
sponsored by, or connected to Goat, Wolf & Cabbage or any of the creators or
publishers of Secret Hitler. Nothing in this work should be taken to suggest
that the licensors endorse this adaptation or its author.

The name "Secret Hitler" is used here descriptively, to identify which game
this application accompanies.

